      "retrieved": "2026-10-14",
      "revision": 1297893490,
      "text": "Eragrostis cilianensis is a species of grass known by several common names, including stinkgrass, candy grass, and gray lovegrass."
    },
    "pt": {
      "source": "Wikipedia (pt): Eragrostis cilianensis",
      "source_url": "https://pt.wikipedia.org/wiki/Eragrostis_cilianensis",
      "license": "CC BY-SA 4.0",
      "license_url": "https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/",
      "retrieved": "2026-10-14",
      "revision": 40537857,
      "text": "Eragrostis cilianensis é uma espécie de planta com flor pertencente à família Poaceae."
    },
    "id": {
      "source": "Wikipedia (id): Eragrostis cilianensis",
      "source_url": "https://id.wikipedia.org/wiki/Eragrostis_cilianensis",
      "license": "CC BY-SA 4.0",
      "license_url": "https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/",
      "retrieved": "2026-10-14",
      "revision": 26533964,
      "text": "Eragrostis cilianensis adalah sebuah spesies rumput yang dikenal dengan beberapa nama umum, yang meliputi stinkgrass, candy grass, dan gray lovegrass. Tumbuhan tersebut berasal dari sebagian besar Eurasia dan Afrika selain banyak didatangkan ke wilayah lain, termasuk nyaris seluruh Amerika Utara."
    }
